{"kind": "deco", "attachment": [1, 1, 0], "findings": [{"level": "error", "title": "The model is too big", "body": "A deco should not exceed 12x12x12 voxels, but yours is 3x14x2.", "voxels": []}, {"level": "error", "title": "2 voxels are almost black", "body": "Trove's style guide asks for nothing darker than (10, 10, 10) - pure black reads as a hole in game. Use a dark grey instead.", "voxels": [4, 36]}], "satisfied": ["A blueprint stores one material per voxel, so alpha-on-solid and specular-on-glass - two of the classic .qb mistakes - can't happen here."], "counts": {"error": 2, "warning": 0, "info": 0}}